abstract: >-
  Local-first, citation-grounded civic-RAG engine over Tokyo Metropolitan
  Assembly deliberation records (plenary + committees, 1999-present).
  Ships engine + facts-only routing pack; fetches only the relevant
  records on demand and never redistributes minutes text.
